      "diagram.description.lifecycle": "Three rungs a concept climbs, left to right: still a draft, which the librarian wrote and nobody has checked; checked by automation, once a refresh records a process: event; confirmed by a person, once a named person records a human: event. An edit after the confirmation drops the rung until a person confirms again. A question reopens the concept, and the rung stays."
